NODE
Expected: 'kept'. Actual: undefined.

node --input-type=module - <<'NODE'
import pLimit from './index.js';
try {
  pLimit(Infinity);
  console.log({threw: false});
} catch (error) {
  console.log({threw: true, name: error.name, message: error.message});
}
NODE
Expected: no throw for a numeric minimum-1 unbounded concurrency. Actual: TypeError.
